{
 "title": "Nodstage: one connected workspace (master)",
 "voice": "am_puck",
 "speed": 1.0,
 "lines": [
  [
   "How many apps does it take to run a creative agency?",
   0.3,
   "am_puck",
   1.0
  ],
  [
   "Depends. What do you need to do?",
   0.3,
   "af_jessica",
   1.0
  ],
  [
   "Find clients. Manage projects. Talk to clients. Get designs approved. Chase payments.",
   0.3,
   "am_puck",
   1.06
  ],
  [
   "So... a lot of apps?",
   0.25,
   "af_jessica",
   0.95
  ],
  [
   "Way too many.",
   0.3,
   "am_puck",
   0.95
  ],
  [
   "Where are your leads?",
   0.18,
   "af_jessica",
   1.05
  ],
  [
   "In a CRM.",
   0.2,
   "am_puck",
   1.0
  ],
  [
   "Projects?",
   0.18,
   "af_jessica",
   1.0
  ],
  [
   "A project management tool.",
   0.2,
   "am_puck",
   1.02
  ],
  [
   "Feedback?",
   0.18,
   "af_jessica",
   1.0
  ],
  [
   "Email. And a separate proofing app.",
   0.2,
   "am_puck",
   1.02
  ],
  [
   "Client conversations?",
   0.18,
   "af_jessica",
   1.0
  ],
  [
   "Somewhere else.",
   0.22,
   "am_puck",
   0.95
  ],
  [
   "Proposals, invoices, payments?",
   0.2,
   "af_jessica",
   1.02
  ],
  [
   "More tools. And none of them seem to know what's happening in the others.",
   0.35,
   "am_puck",
   1.0
  ],
  [
   "What if they were all connected?",
   0.45,
   "af_jessica",
   0.97
  ],
  [
   "Meet Nodstage. One connected workspace built around how creative studios actually work.",
   0.35,
   "bm_fable",
   0.98
  ],
  [
   "Get the business. Deliver the work. Run the business.",
   0.4,
   "bm_fable",
   0.97
  ],
  [
   "Okay. Where do I start?",
   0.22,
   "am_puck",
   1.02
  ],
  [
   "With your leads. Inquiries, discovery calls, follow-ups and proposals, in one pipeline.",
   0.25,
   "af_jessica",
   1.04
  ],
  [
   "And when a deal is won?",
   0.2,
   "am_puck",
   1.02
  ],
  [
   "It becomes a project. Tasks, deadlines and your team's workload.",
   0.25,
   "af_jessica",
   1.03
  ],
  [
   "What about the client?",
   0.2,
   "am_puck",
   1.02
  ],
  [
   "They get their own branded portal. They review proofs, leave visual feedback and approve.",
   0.25,
   "af_jessica",
   1.04
  ],
  [
   "And revisions?",
   0.2,
   "am_puck",
   1.0
  ],
  [
   "Managed right there. Extra work becomes a change order.",
   0.25,
   "af_jessica",
   1.02
  ],
  [
   "Then I still need an invoicing app.",
   0.22,
   "am_puck",
   1.0
  ],
  [
   "No. Invoices and payments live here too. So do your calendar, video messages, forms, templates and automations.",
   0.25,
   "af_jessica",
   1.05
  ],
  [
   "And testimonials?",
   0.2,
   "am_puck",
   1.0
  ],
  [
   "Requested when the client approves.",
   0.35,
   "af_jessica",
   1.0
  ],
  [
   "Track how the whole studio is doing, from the same place.",
   0.35,
   "bm_fable",
   1.0
  ],
  [
   "So I don't need to keep jumping between all those tools?",
   0.25,
   "am_puck",
   1.0
  ],
  [
   "That's the whole point.",
   0.45,
   "af_jessica",
   0.95
  ],
  [
   "Less switching. Less chasing. One connected workflow.",
   0.4,
   "bm_fable",
   0.95
  ],
  [
   "Nodstage is free to start. Sign up at Nodstage dot com.",
   0.3,
   "bm_fable",
   0.97
  ]
 ],
